// `KitTimeMoneyCopySpec` fails when they disagree.
//
// THE 24 WORDS (#1047 E1): making a vault and its words, and typing them back
// to restore or to re-key. Every sentence a member reads on either screen is
// here; no word of the phrase ever is.

